{"type": "message", "id": "879d7bda", "parentId": "85e365ea", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T19:18:03.515Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_855cf454dccb4c1595efd5dc", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"NAEP 2022 mathematics grade 8 state scores table \\\"South Carolina\\\" 270 OR 272 OR 274 Arizona Kansas Kentucky\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 958,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6fff4d79a88d4938\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNOVEMBER 2022\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6fff4d79a88d4938\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://csgsouth.org/wp-content/uploads/QofM-November.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"139d044c6bd92524\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nProcess (NAEP). 2022 Mathematics Assessment. The decline in mathematics scores in the eighth grade is more significant, as 10 states fell below the national average · (274). Virginia (279) was the only state to score above the national average. Missouri (272), North Carolina (274),\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"139d044c6bd92524\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"csgsouth.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b657abf8160b13f5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAnalysis of 2022 NAEP Mathematics and Reading Results\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b657abf8160b13f5\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://whiteboardadvisors.com/analysis-of-2022-naep-mathematics-and-reading-results/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e487537e8d984307\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe National Assessment of Educational Progress (NAEP), commonly known as “The Nation’s Report Card,” recently released